  "title": "April 2026 - shadcn apply",
  "description": "Switch presets in existing projects without starting over.",
  "date": "2026-04-08T00:00:00.000Z"
 },
 "toc": [],
 "hast": "\n<p>We added <code>shadcn apply</code> so you can switch presets in an existing project without starting over.</p>\n<p>When you run <code>npx shadcn@latest apply</code> in an existing project, we apply a new preset, reinstall your existing components, and update your theme, colors, CSS variables, fonts, and icons.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest apply --preset b2D0vQ7G4\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apply</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> b2D0vQ7G4</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>The CLI keeps the current base and RTL settings from your existing project, even when the preset URL was generated with different values.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Button\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;asChild&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;size&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sm&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Link\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/create&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 no-underline!&#x22;}]\"><p>Try a Preset</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>"
}
